PIT 1.30.1, with the JUnit 5 plugin, mutates PetController and
PetValidator and runs the pet tests against each mutant:
./mvnw test-compile org.pitest:pitest-maven:mutationCoverage
The report is in target/pit-reports.

OpenSpec 1.15.0's project folder, created with
"openspec init --tools none": openspec/config.yaml and empty specs and
changes folders. No agent files; they come with the session.

Signed-off-by: Premanand Chandrasekaran <author@example.com>
